  "description": "Based around the proven styling of the Mach-3 this e-bike version of the classic Vitus hybrid retains that reassuringly sporty feel with the added assistance of Shimano’s industry-leading E6100 STEPS power system. Prioritising stress-free riding and comfort, the E-Mach 3 makes life on two-wheels easy and fun.\n\nWhether riding to town, to the office or cruising on weekend adventures this bike takes the sting out of the hills and enables you to go about everyday errands without breaking a sweat. Under the hood, the STEPS drive unit lets you select between ECO, Normal or High mode, depending on how much assistance you require, with all ride stats and controls available at your fingertips from the handlebar-mounted computer unit. The performance is underpinned by a classy lightweight aluminium frame that features a carbon fork and striking kinked top tube, designed to reduce the stepover height for when you might want to leave the activewear at home and ride out in regular clothes.\n\nWe’ve purposefully selected quality, reliable components, including the latest one-piece stem and handlebar with comfortable ergo-grips, to keep weight down so the bike is low maintenance and sleek. Large volume, comfortable tyres are the perfect all-round choice for cycle paths, country roads or wide forest trails, and with mudguard points, internal cable-routing and pannier mounts the E-Mach 3 is a great option for year-round riding and easy-going touring.\n\nJourneys by bike are refreshing, invigorating, more enjoyable and more fun, and with the comfortable and accessible styling of the E-Mach 3 you can do more of them with ease.\n\nEco, Trail or Boost power modes\n\nMicroshift 9 speed gearing\n\nShimano STEPS E8010 504Wh battery\n\nVee G-Sport 700c x 35mm tyres\n\nInternal cable routing, rack mounts and mudguard mounts\n\nPowerful hydraulic disc brakes",
